      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? i dont feel like it's an emergency. its not like i'm having trouble breathing or anything, its just this intense pulling sensation. i've had bad indigestion before and it felt pretty similar. could it just be something like acid reflux or maybe I just strained something? i'm kinda scared to go to the ER just for a muscle ache, it's so expensive.",
